[I] Library for sound files in various MOD formats

[T] Libmikmod is a portable sound library, which used to be
[T] packaged with the MikMod module player, but is now released
[T] independentely. It is capable of playing samples as well as
[T] module files, using the OSS driver for output, as well as
[T] Alsa and EsounD. Supported module format include mod, s3m,
[T] xm, it, med, mtm and 669, to name a few.

[U] https://mikmod.sourceforge.net/

[A] MikMod Project, Miod Vallat <miod@mikmod.org>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/multimedia
[F] CROSS

